# Forces the site theme regardless of domain. Useful when deploying this repo
# as two separate Vercel projects (one per domain) before a custom domain is
# attached, since the temporary *.vercel.app URL won't match a known domain.
# Leave unset to fall back to domain-based detection (see proxy.ts).
#
# SITE_MODE=light
# SITE_MODE=dark

# Shared secret that /api/revalidate checks against the "secret" field Prismic
# sends in its webhook payload. Must match the "Secret" value entered when
# creating the webhook in the Prismic dashboard (Settings > Webhooks).
# PRISMIC_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
